WEBVTT

00:00:02.397 --> 00:00:05.751
Open Settings.

00:00:05.751 --> 00:00:07.933
Archive & delete holds both jobs.

00:00:07.933 --> 00:00:10.426
Tick the folders to clear.

00:00:10.426 --> 00:00:14.325
Choose the years.

00:00:14.325 --> 00:00:17.051
Choose when and how to delete.

00:00:17.051 --> 00:00:18.626
The summary shows what will be removed.

00:00:18.626 --> 00:00:20.805
Tick the confirmation and Start.

00:00:20.805 --> 00:00:22.656
The job starts and runs in the background.

00:00:22.656 --> 00:00:29.656
The progress panel follows the job. The wait is shortened here.

00:00:29.656 --> 00:00:33.827
The job finishes.

00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:38.774
The Vault view still holds the archived emails.

00:00:38.774 --> 00:00:40.333
The Server view no longer lists them.
